# Exception: curated aggregate.json files co-located with benchmark/experiment
# docs are tracked (must come after the global aggregate.json ignore above).
# Raw aggregate.json under results/ stays ignored (results/ is ignored wholesale).
!benchmarks/**/aggregate.json
!experiments/**/aggregate.json

